fixture tech07_coyote_dash
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 7 "Coyote dash: dash off a ledge within coyote time keeps ground cooldown rules"
room test/cliff
spawn 900 320
frames 60
input
  0..15 R
  # Walked off the edge on frame 10; frame 16 is the sixth airborne frame, the last of coyote time.
  16 U R dash
  17..29 R
  30 R dash
  31..59 R
end
expect
  at 10 state=air air_frames=0
  # A ground dash: horizontal whatever the stick says, on the ground cooldown, and the air dash
  # is still there afterwards.
  at 16 event.dash=1 air_frames=6 vy=0 vx=5120 dash_cooldown=24 air_dashes=1
  at 30 event.dash=1 air_dashes=0
end
